          "text": "~ 23 ~ \nInnova o‘quv markazi \n         \nSardor Berdiyev"
        },
        {
          "order": 1,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 311.93,
            "y": 96.33,
            "w": 176.57,
            "h": 22.49
          },
          "text": "A) 0.     B) 1.     C) 2.     D) 2,5.     E) 4,5."
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 28.32,
            "y": 98.73,
            "w": 212.45,
            "h": 35.57
          },
          "text": "A) 1-sekundida. B) 2-sekundida. C) 3-sekundida.  \nD) 4-sekundida. E) 5-sekundida."
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 28.32,
            "y": 139.86,
            "w": 255.89,
            "h": 11.96
          },
          "text": "9. Grafikdan foydalanib, jismning tezlanishi topilsin (m/s2)."
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 311.93,
            "y": 124.65,
            "w": 231.79,
            "h": 38.93
          },
          "text": "15*. Jism tezligining vaqtga bog‘lanish grafigi rasmda \nko‘rsatilgan. 1-, 2- va 3- nuqtalarga mos keluvchi \ntezlanishlarni taqqoslang."
        },
        {
          "order": 5,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 28.32,
            "y": 218.25,
            "w": 192.29,
            "h": 22.49
          },
          "text": "A) 1,5.      B) 1.     C) 2.     D) 0,75.     E) 0,5."
        },
        {
          "order": 6,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 311.93,
            "y": 218.01,
            "w": 218.57,
            "h": 37.61
          },
          "text": "A) 𝑎1<𝑎2<𝑎3.     B) 𝑎2>𝑎1>𝑎3.      C) 𝑎1=𝑎2=𝑎3.  \nD) 𝑎1>𝑎2>𝑎3.      E) 𝑎2<𝑎1<𝑎3."
        },
        {
          "order": 7,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 28.32,
            "y": 246.57,
            "w": 250.5,
            "h": 25.88
          },
          "text": "10. Rasmdagi grafikdan foydalanib, to‘g‘ri chiziqli harakat \nqilayotgan jismning tezlanishini toping (m/s2)."
        },
        {
          "order": 8,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 311.93,
            "y": 259.92,
            "w": 243.78,
            "h": 25.85
          },
          "text": "16. Tezlanish grafigi chizmada keltirilgan jism harakatini \nchizma qismlari bo‘yicha tavsiflang."
        },
        {
          "order": 9,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 28.32,
            "y": 343.56,
            "w": 172.49,
            "h": 22.37
          },
          "text": "A) 1.     B) 2.     C) 3.     D) 4.     E) 6."
        },
        {
          "order": 10,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 28.32,
            "y": 371.76,
            "w": 250.5,
            "h": 38.93
          },
          "text": "11. Rasmdagi grafikdan foydalanib, to‘g‘ri chiziqli harakat \nqilayotgan jismning t=4,73 s dagi tezlanishini aniqlang \n(m/s2)."
        },
        {
          "order": 11,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 28.32,
            "y": 483.26,
            "w": 187.01,
            "h": 22.49
          },
          "text": "A) 15.     B) 10.     C) 7,5.     D) 5.     E) 2,5."
        },
        {
          "order": 12,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 311.93,
            "y": 361.92,
            "w": 240.05,
            "h": 152.83
          },
          "text": "A) 1, 5 - tinch holat; 3, 4 - tekis harakat; 2 - tekis \ntezlanuvchan harakat. \nB) 3, 4 - tezlanuvchan harakat; 1, 5 - tekis harakat; \n2 - tekis tezlanuvchan harakat. \nC) 2 - tezlanuvchan harakat; 3, 4 - tekis harakat; \n1, 5 - tekis tezlanuvchan harakat. \nD) 2 - tezlanuvchan harakat; 1, 5 - tekis harakat; \n3 - tekis tezlanuvchan harakat; 4 - tekis sekinlanuvchan \nharakat. \nE) 1, 3, 5 - tekis harakat; 2 - tekis tezlanuvchan harakat;  \n4 - tekis sekinlanuvchan harakat."
        },
        {
          "order": 13,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 28.32,
            "y": 511.58,
            "w": 248.69,
            "h": 25.85
          },
          "text": "12. Tezlik modulining vaqtga bog‘lanish grafigidan \nfoydalanib, t = 1,26 s paytdagi tezlanishni aniqlang (m/s2)."
        },
        {
          "order": 14,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 311.93,
            "y": 520.58,
            "w": 235.01,
            "h": 38.93
          },
          "text": "17. Moddiy nuqta tezligining vaqtga bog‘lanishi \n1-rasmdagidek bo‘lsa, tezlanishning vaqtga bog‘lanishi \n2-6 rasmlarning qaysi birida to‘g‘ri tasvirlangan?"
        },
        {
          "order": 15,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 28.32,
            "y": 610.58,
            "w": 179.09,
            "h": 22.52
          },
          "text": "A) 5.     B) 7,5.     C) 10.     D) 30.     E) 2."
        },
        {
          "order": 16,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 28.32,
            "y": 638.93,
            "w": 241.47,
            "h": 25.85
          },
          "text": "13. Quyidagi grafikdagi 𝛼 burchak tangensi qanday fizik \nma’noga ega?"
        },
        {
          "order": 17,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 311.93,
            "y": 713.09,
            "w": 257.83,
            "h": 22.49
          },
          "text": "A) 2.     B) 4.     C) 5.     D) 6.       E) 3."
        },
        {
          "order": 18,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 311.93,
            "y": 741.41,
            "w": 219.89,
            "h": 26.15
          },
          "text": "18. Rasmda keltirilgan tezlik grafigidan foydalanib  \n𝑣 = 𝑣(𝑡) bog‘lanish tenglamasini yozing."
        },
        {
          "order": 19,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 28.32,
            "y": 734.33,
            "w": 185.57,
            "h": 35.45
          },
          "text": "A) tezlanish o‘zgarishi.    B) tezlanish.    \nC) tezlik o‘zgarishi.    D) tezlik.      E) vaqt."
        },
        {
          "order": 20,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 28.32,
            "y": 775.61,
            "w": 240.87,
            "h": 25.85
          },
          "text": "14. Quyidagi grafikdan foydalanib, jismning tezlanishini \naniqlang (m/s2)."
        }
