            "x": 311.93,
            "y": 121.41,
            "w": 250.39,
            "h": 51.89
          },
          "text": "24. 1-rasmda jism tezlanishi proeksiyasining vaqt bo‘yicha \no‘zgarish grafigi keltirilgan. 2-6 rasmlarning \nqaysi birida jism tezligi proeksiyasining vaqt bo‘yicha \no‘zgarish grafigi to‘g‘ri ko‘rsatilgan?"
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 28.32,
            "y": 147.93,
            "w": 254.34,
            "h": 25.85
          },
          "text": "19. Quyidagi grafikning 𝑣= 𝑣(𝑡) tenglamasi qaysi javobda \nto‘g‘ri ifodalangan?"
        },
        {
          "order": 5,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 28.32,
            "y": 256.89,
            "w": 215.09,
            "h": 49.34
          },
          "text": "A) 𝑣= 6– 15𝑡.   \nB) 𝑣= 15 + 2,5𝑡.  \n \nC) 𝑣= 15– 6𝑡.   \nD) 𝑣= 15– 2,5𝑡.  \n \nE) 𝑣= 15 + 6𝑡."
        },
        {
          "order": 6,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 28.32,
            "y": 312.0,
            "w": 205.02,
            "h": 25.85
          },
          "text": "20. Rasmdagi grafik uchun 𝑣= 𝑣(𝑡) bog‘lanish \ntenglamasini yozing."
        },
        {
          "order": 7,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 311.93,
            "y": 328.68,
            "w": 257.83,
            "h": 22.37
          },
          "text": "A) 6.     B) 5.     C) 4.     D) 3.      E) 2."
        },
        {
          "order": 8,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 311.93,
            "y": 356.88,
            "w": 246.16,
            "h": 38.93
          },
          "text": "25. Rasmda to‘g‘ri chiziqli harakat qilayotgan jismning \ntezlik grafigi keltirilgan. Bu harakatning tezlik tenglamasi \nqanday bo‘ladi?"
        },
        {
          "order": 9,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 28.32,
            "y": 413.28,
            "w": 190.25,
            "h": 50.07
          },
          "text": "A) 𝑣= 15– 5𝑡.   \nB) 𝑣= 15– 3𝑡.   \nD) 𝑣= 15 + 3𝑡.  \nC) 𝑣= 15 + 5𝑡. \nE) 𝑣= 3 + 15𝑡."
        },
        {
          "order": 10,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 28.32,
            "y": 468.5,
            "w": 221.69,
            "h": 11.69
          },
          "text": "21. Rasmdagi shtrixlangan yuza nimani ifodalaydi?"
        },
        {
          "order": 11,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 311.93,
            "y": 461.54,
            "w": 250.49,
            "h": 36.11
          },
          "text": "A) 𝑣= 1 + 2𝑡.     B) 𝑣= 1 + 𝑡.     C) 𝑣= 2 + 2𝑡.  \n \nD) 𝑣= 1– 2𝑡.       E) 𝑣= 2 + 𝑡."
        },
        {
          "order": 12,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 311.93,
            "y": 503.42,
            "w": 227.82,
            "h": 25.85
          },
          "text": "26. 𝑣= 𝑣(𝑡) grafikdan foydalanib, 𝑎= 𝑎(𝑡) grafikni \nchizing."
        },
        {
          "order": 13,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 28.32,
            "y": 547.82,
            "w": 232.49,
            "h": 35.57
          },
          "text": "A) tezlanishni.       B) tezlikni.    C) tezlik o‘zgarishini. \nD) yo‘lni. E) koordinata o‘zgarishini."
        },
        {
          "order": 14,
          "bbox": {
            "x": 28.32,
            "y": 589.1,
            "w": 248.81,
            "h": 25.97
          },
          "text": "22. Berilgan grafikdan foydalanib, 5-sekund oxiridagi \ntezlikni toping (m/s). Boshlang‘ich tezlik 36 km/h ga teng."
